   "updated_at": "2026-10-25T03:39:54Z",
   "body": "Delivered on `fix/codex-multi-home-sessions` ([8b9022cd](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/8b9022cd), skygunner's fork, on upstream/main 641b1217):\n\n- **Thread names.** The title cache is per folder now: `codexTitleIndexPaths()` walks `appdir.CodexHomes()`, and `CodexTitles`, `CodexTitleRecipients` and the assembler's `codexTitleOf` read every folder's index beside the main folder's — a session started in `~/.codex-work` shows the name the user gave it in Codex instead of its first prompt. When two folders name one id, the main folder's answer stands. The per-folder caches also make `codexTitleOf`'s reload-when-another-index-was-read rule moot (each folder's read no longer crowds the others out), while the pass-freeze semantics of #3493 stay: one pass reads a session's file and its name as they were together.\n- **State databases.** `codexStateDBs` honours each folder's own `config.toml` `sqlite_home` now, relative to that folder when relative, instead of ignoring it for any folder but `CodexDir()`. `CODEX_SQLITE_HOME` stays the main folder's override and does not reach the others.\n\nRed before (`TestCodexOtherHomeTitlesAndStateDBs`, both halves on the baseline): a name set only in the second folder's index came back empty, and that folder's state DB was found at `state_2.sqlite` in the folder itself instead of `states/state_1.sqlite` where its config said. After, both read as the folder says; a folder with no `sqlite_home` of its own is unchanged, and the env override still moves the main folder's DBs (`TestCodexSqliteHomeEnvIsTheMainFolders`, control).\n\nRun: `go test ./internal/sessions -count=1` (ok), `-tags nogui ./internal/gui ./internal/tui ./internal/cli` (ok), gofmt, go vet, windows/amd64 and darwin/arm64 builds.\n\n**Pickup note (10-25):** the fork branch `fix/codex-multi-home-sessions` later gained my #3531 commit through a working-tree slip (kept as it is, no force-push). This fix alone is on `fix/codex-multi-home-sessions-standalone-1025` ([8b9022cd](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/8b9022cd)), exactly this one commit over upstream main 641b1217, internal/sessions only.",
